[en.FOCUS_C04_REBUILD_HARMONY]
Rebirth of Harmony

[en.FOCUS_C04_REBUILD_HARMONY_desc]
Previously, our pegasus foals could only be educated at home or study in Ponyville or Canterlot. Now as the Wonder —— uh, sorry, the Muffinbolts Academy reopens to the public, we can finally educate our next generation pegasi within the borders of Stratusburg.\nCompared to the twisted textbooks of the Empire, our education system can focus more on the flying skills and combat skills of pegasi, and restore the inheritance of the Harmony ideology of the Princess Twilight era and the Princess Celestia era.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_REBUILD_HARMONY]
谐律的复兴

[zh.FOCUS_C04_REBUILD_HARMONY_desc]
此前，我们的天马幼驹们只能在家中接受教育，到小马谷或坎特洛特留学。如今当闪电 —— 额，我是说，“马芬天马学院”重新对外开放后，我们终于可以在层云堡境内教育我们的下一代天马了。\n相比于帝国那扭曲的教科书，我们的教育体系一方面将可以更加注重天马的飞行技巧和战斗技能，另一方面，则要恢复对暮光公主时期以及塞拉斯蒂娅时期的谐律主义思想的传承。

